      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p><strong>PREPARATION&nbsp;FOR&nbsp;TRANSFER&nbsp;AT&nbsp;THE&nbsp;JUNIOR&nbsp;LEVEL</strong></p><p></p><p>No&nbsp;audition&nbsp;is&nbsp;required&nbsp;for&nbsp;admission&nbsp;into&nbsp;the&nbsp;College&nbsp;or&nbsp;the&nbsp;major.</p><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Auditions&nbsp;are&nbsp;required&nbsp;for&nbsp;enrollment&nbsp;into&nbsp;acting&nbsp;courses.&nbsp;Students&nbsp;who&nbsp;have&nbsp;not&nbsp;received&nbsp;course&nbsp;credit&nbsp;for&nbsp;an&nbsp;acting&nbsp;class&nbsp;at&nbsp;a&nbsp;previous&nbsp;college&nbsp;must&nbsp;start&nbsp;with&nbsp;auditioning&nbsp;for&nbsp;Fundamentals&nbsp;of&nbsp;Acting&nbsp;I.&nbsp;Students&nbsp;who&nbsp;have&nbsp;received&nbsp;course&nbsp;credit&nbsp;for&nbsp;one&nbsp;acting&nbsp;course&nbsp;may&nbsp;audition&nbsp;for&nbsp;Fundamentals&nbsp;of&nbsp;Acting&nbsp;II.&nbsp;Students&nbsp;who&nbsp;have&nbsp;received&nbsp;course&nbsp;credit&nbsp;from&nbsp;more&nbsp;than&nbsp;one&nbsp;acting&nbsp;course&nbsp;may&nbsp;audition&nbsp;for&nbsp;Intermediate&nbsp;Acting.</span></p><p></p><p>The&nbsp;following&nbsp;lower&nbsp;division&nbsp;Theater&nbsp;and&nbsp;Performance&nbsp;Studies&nbsp;courses&nbsp;are&nbsp;required&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;major:</p><p></p><ul><li>10&nbsp;Fundamentals&nbsp;of&nbsp;Acting&nbsp;I</li><li>60&nbsp;Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Technical&nbsp;Theater&nbsp;and&nbsp;Production</li><li>26&nbsp;Introduction&nbsp;to&nbsp;Performance&nbsp;Studies</li><li>52AC&nbsp;Dance&nbsp;in&nbsp;American&nbsp;Cultures&nbsp;or&nbsp;25AC&nbsp;The&nbsp;Drama&nbsp;of&nbsp;American&nbsp;Cultures</li></ul><p></p><p>NOTES:</p><ul><li>Once&nbsp;admitted&nbsp;to&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley,&nbsp;a&nbsp;student&nbsp;should&nbsp;arrange&nbsp;an&nbsp;individual&nbsp;advising&nbsp;session&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;major&nbsp;advisor&nbsp;to&nbsp;discuss&nbsp;the&nbsp;possible&nbsp;applicability&nbsp;of&nbsp;prior&nbsp;course&nbsp;work&nbsp;as&nbsp;well&nbsp;as&nbsp;future&nbsp;program&nbsp;planning.</li><li>A&nbsp;transferable&nbsp;beginning&nbsp;acting&nbsp;course&nbsp;comparable&nbsp;to&nbsp;THEATER&nbsp;10&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;used&nbsp;to&nbsp;satisfy&nbsp;a&nbsp;major&nbsp;requirement.</li><li>Courses&nbsp;comparable&nbsp;to&nbsp;THEATER&nbsp;25AC,&nbsp;52AC,&nbsp;and&nbsp;26&nbsp;are&nbsp;generally&nbsp;not&nbsp;available&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;community&nbsp;college&nbsp;and&nbsp;must&nbsp;be&nbsp;taken&nbsp;during&nbsp;your&nbsp;first&nbsp;semester&nbsp;at&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley.</li><li>THEATER&nbsp;25AC/52AC&nbsp;may&nbsp;not&nbsp;be&nbsp;fulfilled&nbsp;by&nbsp;any&nbsp;other&nbsp;American&nbsp;Cultures&nbsp;(AC)&nbsp;course.</li><li>AP&nbsp;and&nbsp;IB&nbsp;courses&nbsp;do&nbsp;not&nbsp;fulfill&nbsp;major&nbsp;prerequisites.</li></ul>",
        "groupId": "e4e86f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 4,
